        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Final supervisor-demo boundary\n\n**One live scenario-mode run only.** The paper results remain the separately frozen 180-cell R10 oracle benchmark. n8n coordinates the workflow; deterministic policy, evidence validation, admissibility, anchoring and governed-action logic remain explicit. AUTOMATIC is a dry-run simulation, HUMAN/PRIVILEGED requires review, and NEVER is rejected. No production O-RAN actuation.",
