      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## 1. Inputs and knowledge grounding\nScenario JSON → hash binding → bounded query → Qdrant retrieval and optional reranking → frozen standards-evidence bundle.\n\n**Modes:** NO_RAG, RAG, AGENTIC_RAG.",
